{"id": "000101", "text": "我对这愈来愈厉害了!", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.75, "arousal": 0.7, "dominance": 0.8}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.85, "dominance": 0.45}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": null, "context": "你要放弃了吗？", "source": "opensubtitles", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是自信逞强说越来越厉害，但面对“你要放弃了吗”的质问，真实情绪是被逼到极限的焦躁与虚张声势，外强中干。", "human_gold": false}
