{"id": "000003", "text": "生活仅仅是一个美梦", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.85, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.5}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.35}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": null, "context": "你的脸就跟老男人的\"鸟蛋\"那么臭", "source": "opensubtitles", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面把生活说成美梦，但紧接在粗俗辱骂之后，实为反讽自嘲，真实情绪偏负面且带无奈。", "human_gold": false}
