{"id": "000028", "text": "我现在不想谈话.", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.55}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.6}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": null, "context": "你在我爸爸的书房里干什么", "source": "opensubtitles", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是平静拒绝谈话，但被撞见在书房里，真实情绪带防备和紧张，语气偏冷硬而非真的无所谓。", "human_gold": false}
