{"id": "000146", "text": "我还以为我都摆脱不了这借钱生活了呢", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.75, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.8, "arousal": 0.6, "dominance": 0.65}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "小杰一定不想看芭比娃娃", "source": "opensubtitles", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面表达如释重负的庆幸，语气轻松带调侃，真实情绪同样是松了口气的喜悦，两者一致。", "human_gold": false}
