{"id": "000117", "text": "那么,河在哪儿?", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.5, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.5}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.6, "dominance": 0.4}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": null, "context": "你犯了一个致命的错误， 克莱尔为这事把生命都搭上去", "source": "opensubtitles", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面只是平静询问河的位置，但上下文指责致命错误、克莱尔搭上性命，真实情绪是压抑的震惊与追问，带着不安和被动。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000098", "text": "他说他知道了你们的藏身处", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.5}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.7, "dominance": 0.45}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "我得说", "source": "opensubtitles", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是转述消息、略带紧张；真实情绪是警觉不安，语气急促，与字面基本一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000011", "text": "And all the weed l be smokin' is farmer's hay", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.55, "arousal": 0.45, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.7}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "你8点回房。", "source": "opensubtitles", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是吹嘘自己抽的只是农夫干草，带调侃自嘲；结合“8点回房”的管束语境，真实情绪是嘴硬逞强、略带不满的自我标榜，但未到明显反讽矛盾。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000007", "text": "那根本不够分", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.3, "arousal": 0.4, "dominance": 0.5}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.6, "dominance": 0.6}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "那么我们当然...", "source": "opensubtitles", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面陈述资源不足，带不满；语气中透出急切与施压，情绪一致偏负面。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000113", "text": "你永远找不到她", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.15, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.7}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.6, "dominance": 0.75}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": null, "context": "通常我至少会问一个问题", "source": "opensubtitles", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是威胁式断言，语气笃定带掌控感，真实情绪与字面一致，略带敌意与自信。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "000109", "text": "就有无坚不摧的力量", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.75, "arousal": 0.6, "dominance": 0.8}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.45, "dominance": 0.55}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": null, "context": "噢没有", "source": "opensubtitles", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面在夸耀力量强大，但前句“噢没有”透出迟疑与自我怀疑，真实语气更像逞强或反讽，情绪并不如字面正面。", "human_gold": false}
